          {
            "arabic_text": "O so-and-so, it is astonishing for so-and-how he came to acquire this Matter (Al-Wilayah)', and these are the words of my father (peace be upon him): 'By Allah, it is not astonishing to see the one who is destroyed, how he came to be destroyed, but it is astonishing to see the one who was saved, how he came to be saved'.",
